hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"477","Hazrat Anas bin Malik raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aasani karo aur dushwari na karo, aur khushkhabri do aur nafrat na dilao."
"478","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya: Bani Israil mein ek shakhs mehmaan utra to ghar mein ek billi thi to us ne us se kaha: Ai billi hamare mehmaan par na phunko to us ke pait mein jo us ke chhote bachche the woh phunne lage phir us ne is ka zikr apne nabi alaihis salam se kiya to unhon ne farmaya: Beshak is ki misaal is ummat ki misaal jaisi hai jo tumhare baad aayegi us ke jahil us ke ulama par ghalib aayenge."
"479","Ummul Momineen Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ne farmaya: Main ek sarkash oont par thi to main use maarne lagi to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Narmi karo pas beshak narmi jis cheez mein bhi hoti hai use zeenat deti hai aur jis cheez se nikaal li jati hai use aibdaar kar deti hai."
"480","Abu Nazra ne kaha: Hamari qaum ka ek shakhs tha jise Jabir ya Juwaibir kaha jata tha phir us ne bayan kiya ke woh apni ek haajat ke liye un ki khilafat mein Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ke paas aaya to raat ko Madina pahuncha phir jab subah hui to un ke paas aaya aur woh ek zaheen khush kalaam shakhs tha to woh duniya ki mazammat karne laga aur us ki burai wazeh karne laga aur is par daleel qaim karne laga ke is mein koi bhalai nahin aur un ke pehlu mein safed dadhi wala ek shakhs tha jis par safed kapde the phir jab woh apni baat se farigh hua to us ne kaha: Jo kuch tum ne kaha sab mein tum ne durust kaha siwae duniya ki mazammat ke pas woh apne mauqa mein nahin kya tum jaante ho duniya kya hai beshak duniya aakhirat ka samaan hai aur is mein hamare woh aamaal hain jin ki jaza hamen aakhirat mein di jayegi unhon ne kaha: Phir mujh se ek aise shakhs ne kalaam kiya jo mujh se zyada duniya ko jaanne wala tha to main ne kaha: Ai Ameerul Momineen yeh aap ke pehlu mein kaun hai unhon ne kaha: Musalmanon ke sardar Ubayy bin Kaab raziyallahu anhu hain."
"481","Hazrat Bara bin Azib raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Budhape par fakhr karna badtareen amal mein se hai."
"482","Haris bin Laqit rahimahullah ne kaha: Ham mein kuch log the jab un ki ghodi bacha janti to use zibah kar dete aur kehte: Meri jaan ko kya hai ke main is par sawaar hun phir hamare paas Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ka khat aaya: Jo Allah Taala ne tumhen rizq diya hai use durust rakho pas beshak qayamat ka din bahut door hai."
"483","Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Dawood bin Qais ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Miqsam ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Zulm se bacho pas beshak zulm qayamat ke din tareekiyan hain aur kanjoosi se bacho pas beshak kanjoosi ne unhen halaak kiya jo tum se pehle the aur unhen is par ubhara ke unhon ne apne khoon bahaye aur apni hurmaton ko halal kar liya."
"484","Hatim ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Hasan bin Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Munkadir bin Muhammad bin Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne apne walid se unhon ne Jabir se riwayat kiya unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke aakhir mein maskh hoga aur qazf hoga aur khasf hoga aur aaghaz zulm walon se hoga."
